      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Now that we have an exposure slider this would make even more sense, now that we got exposure slider on the camera.\n\nInstead of having to set the exposure on a small, low resolution screen in a VR headset, all that data could be exported to a file where industry standard tools could work on it, e.g. Lightroom or Darktable.\n\nI ran into so many times that my possibly awesome photos are messed up, because I did not adjust the exposure well enough (or maybe didn't even had time to adjust it), and this could solve many of those issues!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
