  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-01-05T11:36:46.165Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I'd like to have a bit more control editing the photos I take in VRCHAT, an option to take photos in an uncompressed (RAW) format, and a flat \"cinema style\" picture profile (like real world cameras have) would massively help virtual photographers get exactly the look they're going for when editing.",
